{"id":188,"title":"计算字符串长度","summary":"在本课中，你将学习如何在Python中使用迭代和递归的方法来计算字符串的长度。","tags":"","components":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"b1e2a2c60b3111ec980c3af9d3c2d1d5","text":"在本课中，我们重点讨论以下问题:\n\n**给定一个字符串，计算其长度。**\n\n如果你正在准备工作面试或者想加深对递归理解以解决实际问题，我们希望这一课对你有所帮助。\n\nPython有一个内置的`len()`函数，可以返回一个字符串的长度。这是在Python中获得字符串长度的标准方法。","text_html":"<p>在本课中，我们重点讨论以下问题:</p>\n<p><strong>给定一个字符串，计算其长度。</strong></p>\n<p>如果你正在准备工作面试或者想加深对递归理解以解决实际问题，我们希望这一课对你有所帮助。</p>\n<p>Python有一个内置的<code>len()</code>函数，可以返回一个字符串的长度。这是在Python中获得字符串长度的标准方法。</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":0},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"b1e2a3f20b3111ec980c3af9d3c2d1d5","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","content":"input_str = \"hello world\"\nprint(len(input_str))","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"b1e2a4240b3111ec980c3af9d3c2d1d5","text":"## 迭代方法\n\n现在我们自己用Python实现计算字符串长度方法，并从迭代的方法开始：","text_html":"<h2>迭代方法</h2>\n<p>现在我们自己用Python实现计算字符串长度方法，并从迭代的方法开始：</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":2},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"b1e2a4560b3111ec980c3af9d3c2d1d5","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","content":"# 循环迭代字符串，时间复杂度: O(n)\ndef iterative_str_len(input_str):\n    input_str_len = 0\n    for i in range(len(input_str)):\n        input_str_len += 1\n    return input_str_len","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":false,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":3},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"b1e2a4740b3111ec980c3af9d3c2d1d5","text":"- **第3行**`input_str_len`初始化为`0`；\n- **第4行**使用`for`循环，逐一迭代`input_str`字符串；\n- **第5行**在每次迭代中将`input_str_len`增加 `1`;\n- 最后循环结束，返回`input_str_len`，其存储了字符串的长度。\n\n由于整个字符串被遍历了一次，所以时间复杂度为$O(n)$，其中$n$是字符串的长度。\n\n## 递归方法\n\n让我们继续看一下递归的方法：","text_html":"<ul>\n<li><strong>第3行</strong><code>input_str_len</code>初始化为<code>0</code>；</li>\n<li><strong>第4行</strong>使用<code>for</code>循环，逐一迭代<code>input_str</code>字符串；</li>\n<li><strong>第5行</strong>在每次迭代中将<code>input_str_len</code>增加 <code>1</code>;</li>\n<li>最后循环结束，返回<code>input_str_len</code>，其存储了字符串的长度。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>由于整个字符串被遍历了一次，所以时间复杂度为<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>，其中<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.43056em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.43056em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span></span></span></span>是字符串的长度。</p>\n<h2>递归方法</h2>\n<p>让我们继续看一下递归的方法：</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":4},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"b1e2a49c0b3111ec980c3af9d3c2d1d5","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","content":"# 递归计算字符串长度，时间复杂度: O(n)\ndef recursive_str_len(input_str):\n    if input_str == '': # 字符串为空是返回0\n        return 0\n    return 1 + recursive_str_len(input_str[1:]) # 递归调用","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"3\n5","runnable":false,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":5},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"b1e2a4ba0b3111ec980c3af9d3c2d1d5","text":"- 如果**第3行**`input_str`是空的，则返回`0`以使空字符串的计数为`0`\n\n- 否则，**第5行** 调用`recursive_str_len(input_str[1:])` 并 `+1`，表示继续递归调用计算字符串`input_str[1:]`的长度并且加1返回，刚好为`input_str` 的长度。\n\n因此，每次递归调用都会使`input_str`缩短一个字符，这在该递归调用中被计算在内。由于将有$n$次递归调用，每个递归调用花费的**计算量不变**，所以时间复杂度是$O(n)$，其中$n$是字符串的长度。\n\n上面递归思想是不是很简单吗？希望你再思考下，想清楚递归思想的应用。\n\n在下面的代码中，可以运行迭代和递归实现的完整代码:","text_html":"<ul>\n<li>\n<p>如果<strong>第3行</strong><code>input_str</code>是空的，则返回<code>0</code>以使空字符串的计数为<code>0</code></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>否则，<strong>第5行</strong> 调用<code>recursive_str_len(input_str[1:])</code> 并 <code>+1</code>，表示继续递归调用计算字符串<code>input_str[1:]</code>的长度并且加1返回，刚好为<code>input_str</code> 的长度。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>因此，每次递归调用都会使<code>input_str</code>缩短一个字符，这在该递归调用中被计算在内。由于将有<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.43056em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.43056em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span></span></span></span>次递归调用，每个递归调用花费的<strong>计算量不变</strong>，所以时间复杂度是<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>，其中<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.43056em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.43056em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span></span></span></span>是字符串的长度。</p>\n<p>上面递归思想是不是很简单吗？希望你再思考下，想清楚递归思想的应用。</p>\n<p>在下面的代码中，可以运行迭代和递归实现的完整代码:</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":6},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"b1e2a4e20b3111ec980c3af9d3c2d1d5","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","content":"# 循环迭代字符串，时间复杂度: O(n)\ndef iterative_str_len(input_str):\n    input_str_len = 0\n    for i in range(len(input_str)):\n        input_str_len += 1\n    return input_str_len\n\n# 递归计算字符串长度，时间复杂度: O(n)\ndef recursive_str_len(input_str):\n    if input_str == '': # 字符串为空是返回0\n        return 0\n    return 1 + recursive_str_len(input_str[1:]) # 递归调用\n\ninput_str = \"hello world\"\n\nprint(len(input_str)) # 内置方法调用\nprint(iterative_str_len(input_str)) # 迭代方法\nprint(recursive_str_len(input_str)) # 递归方法","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":7},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"b1e2a5000b3111ec980c3af9d3c2d1d5","text":"----\n\n下一课中我将继续使用递归思想解决字符串特殊统计相关的问题。","text_html":"<hr />\n<p>下一课中我将继续使用递归思想解决字符串特殊统计相关的问题。</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":8}],"status":"undo","course_no":"004","source_url":"https://edu.py2fun.com/api/course/004/page/188"}
